<title>MEXICO: Mexico's steel output rises during April.</title>
<headline>Mexico's steel output rises during April.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's steel output was a record 1.202 million tonnes in April, up 13.7 percent compared to the same month of the year before, the National Iron and Steel Industry Chamber said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
